{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃんの事が大好きな、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46   二期生   宮崎県出身\nまつりちゃんこと松田里奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いていただきありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobtMzT4O.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃん7年半の活動お疲れ様！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5月12日、13日は、\n｢14th Single BACKS LIVE!!｣、｢武元唯衣 卒業セレモニー｣でしたね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お越しいただいた皆様、配信をご覧いただいた皆様、ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "BACKS LIVE!!を見る度に、一人一人が輝き過ぎて、こんなすごいメンバーがたくさんいる事が誇りだなといつも思います！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして唯衣ちゃんのラストライブ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒業セレモニーにメンバーみんな参加させていただきました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobKAQB5B.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃんのドレスとっても可愛かったな！プリンセスだったな！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒に｢紋白蝶が確か飛んでた｣できて嬉しかったな！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しかったけど、儚くて寂しかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まさかのドレスがパンツスタイルになるのカッコよすぎたな！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドレスでダンストラックかましちゃうなんてカッコよすぎる！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きな｢油を注せ！｣一緒にできて嬉しかった！！\n参加させてくれてありがとう！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回のダンストラックも相当な短期間で作り上げるなんてあなた天才すぎね！いや、唯衣ちゃんの努力なんだけど！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "期別部分があったから、二期生の振り入れの時間楽しかったな\nみんなで相談しながら作る時間大好き"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回もダンスめっちゃ楽しかったよ！！\n素敵な振り付け作ってくれてありがとう！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobfJ5XNS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃんにね、ある時\"寂しい\"って送ろうとしてたけど、忙しいよねって思って送るの我慢した"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも唯衣ちゃんからたまたま連絡来た！ラッキー！\nその時に寂しいって言えた！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobjMBerb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会えた時も嬉しくて、大っきい声で唯衣ちゃんって呼んじゃう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "つまり唯衣ちゃんのこと大好きってこと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "懐かしい写真たち"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob0n2kBA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に最年少だと思ってた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃんは年下だけど加入した時からしっかりしてて、ずっと尊敬してました\nたくさん相談のってくれてありがとう！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobAIncqY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/moboJpzlB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/moblXoraR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この時期は絶対唯衣ちゃんの方がだる絡みしてた\n今は私かもだけど\nでもスイッチ入った時の面倒くささは唯衣ちゃんの方が実はすごいと思う"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob5WBOhF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒に頑張ってアルファベット作ったね\n｢T｣が1番得意です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobBkTJA7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同い年組の絡みすごい好きだったよ\nその時は3人とも年相応になってガキンチョみたいで見てるの好きだったよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobx4iRaj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobDYyPuj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "打ち合わせなしで服が被った時"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobZMK84k.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドローンで隣になったら絶対お互いのタオルより前に自分のタオルを出すくだりをリハーサル中は絶対します"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobOKtV1z.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日楽しすぎて忘れられない\n誘ってくれてありがとう\n唯衣ちゃんとは食の好みがとっても合うのでご飯が最高に楽しいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobmjsJp9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "シンメめっちゃ嬉しかったなーー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobrckkuZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ポジション隣なのも嬉しかったなー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobNdktkC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私ね、やっぱり唯衣ちゃんのダンスだーーいすき！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "踊るのが好きな人のダンスだから、見ていて楽しいしかっこいいし、本当に上手！すごい！\nそんでもって歌も上手だからすごいよね！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobgljCpj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あとね、唯衣ちゃんが居てくれたから乗り越えられたことがたくさんある！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いっつもたくさん褒めれてくれてありがとう！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すごいのは唯衣ちゃんの方だよ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobywEaIe.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私がキャプテンになった時の唯衣ちゃんの優しくて温かい視線とライブ終わりにかけてくれた言葉がすっごく嬉しかったし救われた！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob3yUgbg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃんの人間性、お仕事に対する姿勢や向き合い方、全部尊敬してます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どこに行っても愛されて結果を残す唯衣ちゃんがかっこよかったし誇りです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "努力を惜しまないし、芯をもってるかっこいい人間だし、たくさんの人に愛されてるし、パフォーマンスもすごいし、バラエティもすごいし、唯衣ちゃんは憧れだよ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobQhNoGz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お仕事でもプライベートでも唯衣ちゃんが居てくれたからすっごく楽しかったよ！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃんと出会えて本当によかった！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きで、尊敬してます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃん！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんありがとう！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobd36P39.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobey1tZV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobQmQrVx.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobnubOSB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7年半お疲れ様！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒業おめでとう！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログお読みいただきありがとうございました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね🌺🌴"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "里奈"}], "source": "official"}